      "id": "claim_0cc26b3e465847e284700d15b3d1be29",
      "statement": "`just bump <patch|minor|major|set> [version]` implements odometer versioning (Z rolls 0–9 carrying into Y; Y rolls 0–99 carrying into X, e.g. 0.9.9+patch→1.0.0, 0.99.9+patch→1.0.0) by sed-editing the version in Cargo.toml and the sshub entry in Cargo.lock — no cargo invocation, keeping the pre-commit hook fast and offline; `set` validates the X.Y.Z shape.",
