    {
      "id": "claim_1662c1c7ec2e45948075ada492fce072",
      "statement": "The tracked .githooks/pre-commit hook auto-bumps the patch version on every commit to development (runs `just bump patch`, re-stages Cargo.toml + Cargo.lock) and is enabled per checkout via `just setup-hooks` (git config core.hooksPath .githooks); it exits 0 on any other branch, while a merge/rebase/cherry-pick is in progress, or when `just` is not installed, so it can never block a contributor; it also checks the branch-name shape via scripts/check-branch-name.sh (the substantive commit-type check runs in CI).",
      "evidence": [
