    {
      "id": "claim_f98f2516d8d347448fed4691d265048c",
      "statement": "The lint gate — `cargo fmt`, `cargo fmt --check`, `cargo clippy --all-targets` — must pass before every push, and CI runs the same (clippy with -D warnings, failing on any warning); CI also runs the test suite on Ubuntu and macOS and a branch-naming job that self-tests scripts/check-branch-name.sh and checks every commit type on the branch (skipping forks).",
